            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tobias+Dyckerhoff"}> Tobias Dyckerhoff
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Compact generators in the categories of matrix factorizations
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1215/00127094-1415869"} doi
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0904.4713"} arXiv:0904.4713
          %p
            The definition of a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/triangulated+category"} triangulated category
            of B-branes for the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Landau-Ginzburg+model"} Landau-Ginzburg model
            via
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/matrix+factorization"} matrix factorization
            was proposed by
