                %strong 12
                (2018) 3834–3869
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1093/imrn/rnw332"} doi
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1212.2859"} arXiv:1212.2859
          %p A matrix factorization of a potential W which is a section of a line bundle on an algebraic stack is studied in
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alexander+Polishchuk"}> Alexander Polishchuk
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Arkady+Vaintrob"} Arkady Vaintrob
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Matrix factorizations and singularity categories for stacks
                = succeed ":7" do
                  %strong 61
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.5802/aif.2788"} doi
                %a{:href => "http://www.numdam.org/articles/10.5802/aif.2788"} numdam
            %li
              %p
                A. Polishchuk,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Arkady+Vaintrob"} Arkady Vaintrob
                = succeed "," do
